# MyStockAlert Phase 4 Execution Log
Date: 2026-10-03

## Scope
Alert Engine: portfolio market-open/close events, watchlist thresholds, anti-spam/reset, persistence, and worker integration.

## Implementation
- Added Alembic revision 0003_alert_state.
- Added upper_armed, lower_armed, and last_triggered_at to alert_rules.
- Added backend/app/alerts.py.
- Added POST /api/v1/alerts/evaluate.
- Worker now evaluates alerts after each market quote poll.
- Portfolio session events are deduplicated by user, market, alert type, and local trading date.
- Watchlist upper/lower alerts use quote change_percent from the previous close.

## Anti-spam behavior
- Upper: trigger when change_percent >= upper threshold; disarm until change_percent returns below threshold.
- Lower: trigger when change_percent <= lower threshold; disarm until change_percent returns above threshold.
- A second alert is therefore not emitted while the price remains beyond the threshold.

